---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
import site from '../../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="Dues" description={`Knollwood Village Civic Club ${site.duesYear} dues are $${site.duesAmount} per household and voluntary. See who has contributed and how to pay by Zelle, card, or check.`}>
  <div class="page-head"><div class="container">
        <h1>{site.duesYear} Dues: ${site.duesAmount} per Household</h1>
    <div class="stripe-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="lead">Dues are voluntary. ${site.duesCivic} runs the club and ${site.duesSecurity} pays for the Smith Protective patrol.</p>
    <div class="controls">
      <label for="dues-year"><strong>Year</strong></label> <select id="dues-year"></select>
      <span id="dues-stats" class="stats">Loading…</span>
      <a class="small" href="#pay">Skip to how to pay ↓</a>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="container page-body">
    <h2 id="who-paid" style="margin-top:0">Who Has Contributed</h2>
    <p>Green lots have contributed for the selected year. The treasurer updates this as payments are recorded, so allow a couple of weeks after you pay. Names and amounts are never shown.</p>
    <div class="map-wrap">
      <div class="map-tools"><input id="addr-search" type="search" placeholder="Look up your address" aria-label="Search address" autocomplete="off" /><div id="addr-results" class="results" hidden></div></div>
      <div id="map" class="map" data-base={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}></div>
    </div>
    <p class="small muted">The newsletter has printed this list for years; the map is the same information. If you've paid and your lot isn't green after two weeks, email <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.treasurer}`}>{site.emails.treasurer}</a> with your address and payment date. Zelle payments without an address in the memo are the most common cause.</p>

    <div class="section-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="pay" style="margin-top:0">How to Pay</h2>
        <div class="pay-grid">
          <div class="card card-green">
            <div class="badge badge-green">No fee</div>
            <h3>Zelle</h3>
            <p>Send to <strong>{site.emails.treasurer}</strong>. The payee shows as "Knollwood Village Civic Club." <strong>Put your property address in the memo</strong> so your payment is recorded to the right home.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Check</h3>
            <p>Payable to "Knollwood Village Civic Club." Write your property address on the memo line and mail to:</p>
            <p>{site.mailingAddress.map((l) => <span>{l}<br /></span>)}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
          <h3>PayPal, Venmo, or Debit or Credit Card</h3>
          <p>No PayPal account needed. Card payments cost the club about $12 in fees on a ${site.duesAmount} payment, so please consider contributing <strong>${site.duesWithFees}</strong> to cover them.</p>
          <div id={`paypal-container-${site.paypal.duesHostedButtonId}`}></div>
          <script is:inline src={`https://www.paypal.com/sdk/js?client-id=${site.paypal.clientId}&components=hosted-buttons&enable-funding=venmo&currency=USD`}></script>
          <script is:inline define:vars={{ id: site.paypal.duesHostedButtonId }}>
            window.paypal && paypal.HostedButtons({ hostedButtonId: id }).render('#paypal-container-' + id);
          </script>
        </div>

        <h2>Where the Money Goes</h2>
        <p>The Civic Club is voluntary, not a mandatory HOA, so everything below is paid for by neighbors who choose to. Dues fund:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>The Smith Protective patrol</strong>, shared with three neighboring civic clubs. Security is the largest line in the budget.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal fees and insurance</strong> for enforcing the deed restrictions.</li>
          <li><strong>Communication and events</strong>: the newsletter, this website, email alerts, and neighborhood events.</li>
          <li><strong>Beautification and maintenance</strong> of the esplanades and entrance signs.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Renters: please ask your landlord to pay dues on your behalf.</p>
        <p>For questions about a payment, email the KVCC Treasurer at <a href={`mailto:${site.emails.treasurer}`}>{site.emails.treasurer}</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="aside">
        <div class="card card-soft">
          <div class="eyebrow">{site.duesYear} dues</div>
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:2.4rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brown);line-height:1">${site.duesAmount}</div>
          <table class="small" style="margin:.75rem 0">
            <tr><td>Civic club dues</td><td style="text-align:right">${site.duesCivic}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Smith Protective patrol</td><td style="text-align:right">${site.duesSecurity}</td></tr>
            <tr><th>Total per household</th><th style="text-align:right">${site.duesAmount}</th></tr>
          </table>
          <p class="small muted">The board's goal is {site.participationGoal} of households participating.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Giving Extra</h3>
          <p class="small">Anything above ${site.duesAmount} goes to Smith patrol hours. Note "additional security" in your memo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Buying or Selling a Home?</h3>
          <p class="small">There are no mandatory assessments, resale certificates, or transfer fees. <a href={url('/realtors/')}>Details for agents and title companies.</a></p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="../../scripts/dues-map.ts"></script>
</Base>
<style is:global>
  .controls { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .controls select { font: inherit; padding: .4rem .6rem; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid #b9b4a6; background: #fff; }
  .stats { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .pay-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .pay-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .pay-grid .card + .card { margin-top: 0; }
  .map-wrap { position: relative; margin: 1rem 0 1rem; }
  .map { height: 600px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); background: #eef1ee; z-index: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .map { height: 460px; } }
  .map-tools { position: absolute; top: .75rem; left: 3.5rem; right: .75rem; z-index: 500; max-width: 380px; }
  .map-tools input { width: 100%; padding: .65rem .8rem; border: 1px solid #b9b4a6; border-radius: 999px; font: inherit; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .results { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); max-height: 220px; overflow: auto; margin-top: .25rem; }
  .results button { display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; background: none; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: .5rem .8rem; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .results button:hover { background: var(--gold-soft); }
  .leaflet-popup-content { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.45; }
  .leaflet-popup-content h4 { margin: 0 0 .25rem; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .map-legend { background: #fff; padding: .6rem .8rem; border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .map-legend h5 { margin: 0 0 .3rem; font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .map-legend .sw { display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; margin-right: .4rem; vertical-align: -1px; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.25); }
</style>
